# What sparkpykafkajoin.py actually writes to the customer-risk topic.
#
# A Kafka sink produces no console output, so kafkajoin.log shows that the job ran
# but not what it emitted. This is the payload itself, read straight off the topic
# that the STEDI graph subscribes to:
#
#   docker compose exec -T kafka kafka-console-consumer \
#       --bootstrap-server kafka:19092 --topic customer-risk --from-beginning
#
# 3000 messages were read, covering 81 distinct customers. Listed below is
# the first message for each, so the sample shows the spread of birth years and
# scores that reaches the graph rather than one customer's repeated re-scorings.
# Captured 2026-09-16T22:53:47Z.

